findings.recommendation:
Either keep the current form and make the invariant harder to break (a one-line note on togglePause that the Load/Store pair is only safe because the flag has a single writer goroutine), or make the toggle self-contained:

```go
for {
    old := app.config.paused.Load()
    if app.config.paused.CompareAndSwap(old, !old) {
        break
    }
}
```

No change is required for this task to ship; this is a durability note for Tasks 3 and 5, which add the second and third writers.
